  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDF PUM 2013 Prog Dev &amp; Monitor</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PDF PUM 2013 Prog Dev &amp; Monitor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med programutvecklingsfonden (PUM) &#xe4;r att h&#xf6;ja kvaliteten p&#xe5; utarbetandet, &#xf6;vervakningen och utv&#xe4;rderingen av programmet. Revisionstj&#xe4;nster genom ambassadens avropsavtal kommer ocks&#xe5; att finansieras inom ramen f&#xf6;r detta bidrag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Programme Development Fund (PUM) is to enhance the quality of programme preparation, monitoring and evaluation. Audit services through the Embassy&#xb4;s Call-Off agreement will also be financed under this contribution.</narrative>
  </description>
